   is not consent.
3. Redistribution: keep this License and copyright notices; mark modified
   copies; do not apply stricter terms than this License.
4. The Program is provided "AS IS", without any warranties; the author is
   not liable for any damages arising from the use of the Program.
5. This License is effective upon receipt of the Program and applies
   perpetually. A separate written agreement with the author prevails.

In case of conflict between the Russian and English versions, the Russian
text prevails.
